	(text "Power: 12 V in -> 30 A ATO main fuse -> bidirectional load-dump TVS -> LM74700 ideal diode with 2 x CSD18540Q5B in parallel (reverse polarity) -> +12V.\nTPS54360 buck 12 V -> 5 V (2 A, 600 kHz, values per TI datasheet example; verify with WEBENCH). USB VBUS ORed into +5V via B5819W. AMS1117-3.3 -> +3V3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
